{
  "uid": "activity-descriptor-business",
  "title": "Activity Descriptor — Business metrics & SLOs",
  "description": "Business view of the activity-descriptor demo: real HTTP traffic/SLOs from the running API plus LLM/agent and run metrics. Agent panels show an explicit 'no traffic yet' state until the backend serves an LLM-backed interview; nothing is faked.",
  "tags": [
    "activity-descriptor",
    "business",
    "llm",
    "slo",
    "grafana"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "API scrape",
      "description": "Prometheus scrape health of the running API in the selected mode (compose api:8080 or host backend). 1 = UP. The target list below shows exactly which one is configured.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(last_over_time(up{job=~\"activity-descriptor-api.*\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "up",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "API not being scraped",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "HTTP requests (selected range)",
      "description": "Real HTTP requests recorded by the API in the dashboard time range (counter increase, Prometheus samples only).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(activity_descriptor_http_requests_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "requests"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "no HTTP traffic in range"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx error ratio (SLO < 1%)",
      "description": "Share of 5xx responses over the selected range. Empty when there is no traffic in range.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(activity_descriptor_http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(activity_descriptor_http_requests_total[$__rate_interval])), 0.000001)",
          "legendFormat": "5xx ratio"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "noValue": "no HTTP traffic in range",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "API availability (SLO >= 99.9%)",
      "description": "Fraction of successful Prometheus scrapes of the API in the selected range. 1 = every scrape succeeded.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "avg_over_time((max(up{job=~\"activity-descriptor-api.*\"}))[$__range:1m])",
          "legendFormat": "availability"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "noValue": "no scrape data in range",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.99
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.999
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "LLM calls (last 15m)",
      "description": "Live-traffic check for the agent pipeline. Always renders a value: 0 with the text \"no LLM traffic (15m)\" means the backend has not served an LLM-backed interview in the last 15 minutes. The agent charts below keep the retained history. Counters reset when the backend process restarts.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(activity_descriptor_agent_calls_total[15m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "calls",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "no LLM traffic (15m)",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "no LLM traffic (15m)",
                  "color": "text",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "LLM error ratio (last 5m)",
      "description": "Share of failed agent calls in the last 5 minutes. No data is shown until there is recent LLM traffic, so a quiet demo does not look like a healthy or a failing pipeline; the \"LLM calls (last 15m)\" stat above is the live-traffic indicator.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(activity_descriptor_agent_calls_total{status!=\"ok\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(activity_descriptor_agent_calls_total[5m])), 0.000001)",
          "legendFormat": "error ratio",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "noValue": "no LLM traffic in the last 5m",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP request rate by route",
      "description": "Real request rate per normalized route (run ids are never used as labels).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(activity_descriptor_http_requests_total[$__rate_interval])) by (route)",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP latency p95 by route",
      "description": "Real 95th percentile HTTP latency from the internal/metrics histogram (SLO target < 2s).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(activity_descriptor_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])) by (le, route))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM requests by agent",
      "description": "Rate of real LLM agent calls per agent. The panel stays empty with an explicit message until the backend serves an LLM-backed interview.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (agent) (rate(activity_descriptor_agent_calls_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{agent}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "no LLM traffic yet — run an interview"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM tokens by direction",
      "description": "Real input/output token rates per agent and model. Empty until LLM traffic exists.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (agent, direction) (rate(activity_descriptor_agent_tokens_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{agent}} {{direction}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "no LLM traffic yet — run an interview"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM latency p95",
      "description": "Real 95th percentile LLM call latency per agent. Empty until LLM traffic exists.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(activity_descriptor_agent_latency_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])) by (le, agent))",
          "legendFormat": "{{agent}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "no LLM traffic yet — run an interview"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Runs by status",
      "description": "Completed activity-descriptor runs per 10 minutes by terminal status. Empty until a run completes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (increase(activity_descriptor_runs_total[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "no completed runs yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Prometheus scrape targets (this config)",
      "description": "The only API target Prometheus is configured to scrape in the selected mode. There is no cross-mode api:8080/host target, so the demo never shows an expected-DOWN target.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "last_over_time(up{job=~\"activity-descriptor-api.*|prometheus\"}[1m])",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 29
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Reading this dashboard\n\n**HTTP panels read real Prometheus samples** scraped from the running API (`activity_descriptor_http_*`), so they are populated as soon as the backend serves any request.\n\n**Agent/LLM panels only get samples after the backend serves an LLM-backed interview.** They reset when the backend process restarts; Prometheus keeps the history for its retention window. The **LLM calls (last 15m)** and **LLM error ratio (last 5m)** stats are the live-traffic indicators: before the first call they show *no LLM traffic* instead of a misleading zero. The agent charts may still show earlier recorded traffic inside the selected window; that history is real Prometheus data, not a fake.\n\n**To populate the agent panels (real traffic, no fakes):** run one interview against the running API (see `docs/API.md` / `docs/DEMO_RUNBOOK.md`), then wait one scrape interval (15 s).\n\n**SLOs shown here:** API availability >= 99.9% of scrapes, 5xx ratio < 1%, HTTP p95 < 2 s, LLM error ratio < 5%. Alert rules that back these targets are in `deploy/prometheus/alerts.yml` and evaluated by Prometheus (UI -> Alerts); notification routing needs an Alertmanager, which is not part of this local demo.\n\n**Target list (left)** shows exactly the API target configured in the selected mode: `deployment=host` for a backend on the Docker host, `deployment=compose` for the compose `api` service. The two modes use separate scrape configs, so there is never an expected-DOWN `api:8080` target in the demo."
      }
    }
  ]
}
